WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.200
Who's short.

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:07.059
Before the contest, see who still needs to sign up.

00:00:07.259 --> 00:00:09.883
After it, switch to who didn't work what they owed.

00:00:10.083 --> 00:00:11.791
Tap a family to open it.

00:00:11.991 --> 00:00:16.840
Download CSV gives you the list as a spreadsheet, for the band account.

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:20.340
Next: the hat.
